<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Stucco repair in Southwest Calgary starts with working out what kind of wall you have. For this page, southwest means the City's West and South sectors. The City's own neighbourhood labels run from 1980s and 1990s areas such as Signal Hill, Patterson, Millrise and Shawnessy to 2000s ones such as Valley Ridge and Bridlewood, so a repair that suits one wall can be wrong for the next.</p><p>Sandstone Stucco Co is an advertising service paid by independent Calgary stucco contractors. It does no stucco work itself and holds no licence, insurance or warranty. The contractor who visits your house quotes and contracts with you directly. Call <strong>(403) 555-0148</strong> or send the form for a no-obligation quote.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Do in Southwest Calgary</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">Services for Southwest Calgary Properties</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3D8C6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(122,90,50,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 8px;">Crack and patch repair</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Hairline cracks, chips and small patches on cement or acrylic finishes. One Calgary contractor, Calgary Parging, lists small patch repairs at $550 to $1,125 before GST; the contractor who sees your wall sets the real figure.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3D8C6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(122,90,50,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 8px;">Hail damage repair estimates</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">A written repair estimate from a contractor that you can pass to your insurer. Your policy and your insurer decide what is covered, and this site does not handle claims.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3D8C6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(122,90,50,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 8px;">Woodpecker hole repair</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Northern flicker holes patched and reinforced once nesting has ended. Calgary Parging says a typical single patch with reinforcement runs $600 to $800 (GST not stated).</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3D8C6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(122,90,50,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 8px;">Parging and window perimeters</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Cosmetic recoats of the parging at the base of a wall and repairs around windows and doors. Foundation crack repair, waterproofing and structural work are not offered through this page.</p>
      </div>
</div>
<style>
